Subject: [PATCH] W1-01 ZGC: ZGC tuning startup report

Aggregates patches 0001-0004 into a single startup log report covering
the acceptance dimensions observable in-process, plus actionable
advice lines. Depends only on earlier patches of this series and the JDK.
